iles - apparel/home-textile exports + synthetics","tag":"Textiles","theme":"Consumer & Retail","tier":"1"}],"thesis":"Asset-light global apparel sourcing platform navigating a tough FY26 (cautious consumers, tariff turbulence, retailer inventory discipline). Delivered modest top-line growth (GMV +5%, Rev +4%) but EBITDA/PAT declined YoY on restructuring/redundancy one-offs and new-vertical drag. Core thesis intact and arguably strengthening structurally: retailers under cost pressure are outsourcing design + sourcing operations (sourcing-as-a-service / SaaS), and PDS + Li & Fung are the only credible global players at RFQ stage. Balance sheet materially de-levered (net debt ₹374cr → ~₹105cr; NWC 17d → 4d). FY27 framed as \"restoration of profitability\" year (cautious mid-single-digit revenue, ~10% PAT growth), then mid-teens medium-term growth. Order book +11% (Americas +30%) gives FY27 visibility. Brands the one weak/under-review segment.","trig":[]},"lm":"","m":5221,"mem":0,"pdd":"","prev_stage":4,"prev_zone_vpe":null,"r":null,"s":"PDSL","sig":"","sx":{"SMA_50":"361.0","base_count":"","drawdown_from_prev_signal":"","duration_from_prev_signal":"","pct_below_52w_high":"12.0","pct_change_from_prev_signal":"","pivot_close":"","pivot_low":"","stage_changed_since_prev_signal":"","vpe_df_60d_sum":"-0.4","vpe_zone_cumul_df":"-0.6"},"t":""}},"s":"PDSL"}